==Restrictions==
Rarity: Only [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Possessed Empress]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 43.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>, delay 56.67~63.33 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 366.67 seconds<sup>11,000f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even with the added restriction, this stage is still ridiculously easy assuming you have the right units. In particular, [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] is still available for use and can still destroy this stage. As for the peons, a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] will shred both the SBKs and Doge Darks, while Talented [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] works great as a meatshield here. As for the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] threats, [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] is incredibly useful for stalling them and is bulky enough to survive the non-Aku threats. To dispose of them, you can use [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], but if you don't have him, bring any decent [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|anti-Aku]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]].

