==Trivia==
*The Devil's Rhythm's English localization is inconsistent with [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Aku's Melody]]. Aku's Melody's Japanese name is Akuma no Senritsu (悪魔の旋律, "Devil's Melody"), and became Aku's Melody because Akuma (悪魔, "Devil") is the Japanese name of the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait; as such, The Devil's Rhythm's Japanese name, Akuma no Ritsudō (悪魔の律動, "Devil's Rhythm"), would logically become "Aku's Rhythm", but 悪魔 was instead translated as "The Devil".
*The Devil's Rhythm and [[Babies First (Merciless)|Babies First]] are the only [[Restriction Stage]]s to allow [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] but not [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]].

